== evidence 1: release acceptance test report (2026-03-02)
requirement REQ-7: "Average response time of the get API shall be under 5 ms."
test tool: one client thread, sends a get, waits for the reply, sleeps to keep 100 req/s
requests: 5995   mean: 1.96 ms   p99: 9.16 ms   max: 15.07 ms   verdict: PASS

